            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "HoaSF\nHanoi, Vietnam145 contributions\n0\nGood food, service needs to be more qualified evenly\nAug 2017 • Solo\nI come here often, most of the time solo. There is combo 299,000 vnd where you get almost everything in the restaurant, you can choose mantou for starter, many kinds of salad, pork, beef, side dishes to rolls with, after barbecue-time, you could choose either Bibibap, which is mix steamed-rice with pork/beef and vegetable or hot pot (kimchi hot pot or Bulgogi hotpot), then for the desserts, they serve fresh fruits, panna cotta, caramel. I find this package is my preference\nThis restaurant have À la carte menu\nI come here time to time, but these experiences are very diffenrent. The service could be excellent and helpful with bright smile, or sometime very lack of attentive. This is a BBQ restaurant, so it's not for you if you need a quick lunch. Enjoyable!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 2, 2017",
